OL,3,GNEWSAPolice end 'active inquiry' into
OL,4,A1998 disappearance of Fife teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have concluded the "active
OL,7,Finquiry" into the disappearance of a
OL,8,Fteenager from a house in Fife 28 years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FKenneth Jones was last seen at his
OL,12,Ffamily home in Ancrum Court,
OL,13,FGlenrothes, at about 22:30 on 2
OL,14,FNovember 1998.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland's major investigation
OL,17,Fteam launched a reinvestigation into
OL,18,Fhis disappearance in 2024 and used
OL,19,Fradar to search the property's garden
OL,20,Fearlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
